{"ref":"BDB, עָרְמָה","hw":"עָרְמָה","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">עָרְמָה</span></big>  <strong>n.f. craftiness, prudence</strong>;—<br><strong>1.</strong>  <span dir=\"rtl\">בְע׳</span> <em>craftily</em> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 21:14\" href=\"/Exodus.21.14\">Ex 21:14</a> (E), <a data-ref=\"Joshua 9:4\" href=\"/Joshua.9.4\">Jos 9:4</a> (JE).<br><strong>2.</strong>  <span dir=\"rtl\">ע׳</span> in Pr, in good sense, <em>prudence</em> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 1:4\" href=\"/Proverbs.1.4\">Pr 1:4</a>; <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 8:5\" href=\"/Proverbs.8.5\">8:5</a>, <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 8:12\" href=\"/Proverbs.8.12\">12</a>.","next":"BDB, עָרוּם","prev":"BDB, עֹ֫רֶם"}